          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Silent At-Most-Once"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Ignoring the `send()` callback exception",
            "Calling `future.get()` nowhere",
            "Committing offsets before processing",
            "That is choosing loss, not avoiding duplicates"
